    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumona chalamwiniyi Kana kamukoku chilamiki chimu chanoyu yilamiki yitanu nayiyedi, hinukutiya mumi wumu wahadi amomi awanahakwila nezu dakudidima nindi, Inzaŋa wutali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitali, hinukumona kawalu katooka; mukwakwendelahu wasenda wuta wamukunji. Amwinka chibaaba, hakuya nakwimika mushindu kulonda nawa akemikaŋa mushindu ho-o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalamwiniyi chilamiki chamuchiyedi, hinukutiya mumi wamuchiyedi hakwila nindi, Inzaŋa wutali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikukwidika kawalu kakwawu, kachinana; mukwakwendelahu amwinka jakufumisha kumwena hamaseki, kulonda antu ajahaŋani. Amwinka mpoku yakabali yeneni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalamwiniyi chilamiki chamuchisatu, hinukutiya mumi wamuchisatu hakwila nindi, Inzaŋa wutali. Nami nitali, hinukumona kawalu keyila; mukwakwendelahu wasenda pezu muchikasa chindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukachi kawamomi awana hinukutiya neyi izu, hidikwila nindi, Chikopu chatidiku nedali dimu, niyikopu yabali yisatu nedali dimu; bayi wukisaŋana manji nivinyuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalamwiniyi chilamiki chamuchiwana, hinukutiya izu damumi wamuchiwana hakwila nindi, Inzaŋa wutali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitali, hinukumona kawalu katookoloka; mukwakwendelahu wukweti ijina dindi diyi Kufwa, nikaluŋa kamulondela munyima. Hiyakuyinka wanta wakujaha chibalu champata yahanu hamaseki chamuchiwana, ajahi nampoku yakabali nanzala nayipupu nawanyama amwisaŋa ayisuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalamwiniyi chilamiki chamuchitanu, hinukumona mwishina dakameŋa antu ajahiluwu, akooleli mazu aNzambi nikushimuna kwashimwinuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakubidika nezu datiyakana nawu, Eyi Mwanta wajila, walala, wamba kasompesha antu ashakama hamaseki mwakanyi, kulonda kututendela mashi etu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyinka wejima wawu hamuntu hamuntu, yi kovwelu yakuluka yitooka, hiyakuyileja nawu, Nookenuhu kapinji kakwawu kanti, kulonda akwenu anduŋu nenu, niana kwenu akajahawu neyi chajahiluwu enu akawanini nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalamwiniyi chilamiki chamuchitanu nachimu, hikudi mutentanshi weneni; itaŋwa hidikubalumuka kwiyila bwi neyi chikeleyi chamavuji eyila; kakweji kejima hikakubalumuka nge neyi mashi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nitutumbwa twamwiwulu hitukuholoka hamaseki neyi yikuyu yayisu yinawulumuki chanakankaŋeshuwu mutondu nampepela yeneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwulu hiyakudifumisha neyi mukanda wanavuŋavuŋuwu; nimapidi ejima niyitutu yejima hiyakuyitutulula muyadiŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanta ankanu ahamaseki, niatulamba, niakulumpi janjita, niakwakuheta, niayilobu, nianduŋu ejima, niabula wuduŋu ejima, hiyakubatama mumayeŋu nimumalola akumapidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyila mapidi namalola nawu, Tuhinukilenu, namutusweki tubuli kumwekana kumesu anowu washakama hetanda dawanta, abuli kutuzuwila kudi Kana kamukoku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa ifuku deneni dakuyizuwila dinashiki, wukutwesha kwimanaku hinyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
